{
  "slug": "synthflow-mcp",
  "name": "Synthflow Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connects Claude Code to the Synthflow AI voice-agent platform through its hosted MCP server. Lets Claude manage assistants, phone numbers, calls, and workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `call-review` (Review the last 100 calls for an agent and surface problems), `prompt-review` (Review AI voice-agent prompts, especially Synthflow Single-Prompt, for contradictions, missing context, unsafe tool/action behavior, escalation gaps, compliance risk,…)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `synthflow`, `synthflow-docs`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install synthflow-mcp@claude-community` from `SynthFlowAI/AnthropicPlugin` (`plugins/synthflow`).",
